WEBVTT

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.666
Hello everyone, I'm Chatty Charlie.

00:00:10.666 --> 00:00:14.732
Let's practise some informal phrases in English!

00:00:16.566 --> 00:00:19.232
I've just got a pet crocodile!

00:00:19.633 --> 00:00:21.199
No way!

00:00:22.466 --> 00:00:24.166
You're joking!

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:32.733
You can use 'No way!' when you can't believe what someone said.

00:00:35.933 --> 00:00:43.366
You can also use, 'You're joking!' when something is difficult to believe.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:49.800
I'm going to Paris tomorrow.

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:51.366
Really?

00:00:53.233 --> 00:00:59.466
You can use 'Really?' when you are surprised by what someone's said.

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:09.799
Look at this view!

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:12.933
Wow! It's beautiful!

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:24.200
You can use "Wow!" when someone shows or tells you something amazing.

00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:29.400
Let's practise.

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:36.000
I'll say something and you respond using one of the Everyday English phrases.

00:01:36.733 --> 00:01:40.333
Sometimes more than one answer is possible.

00:01:41.633 --> 00:01:43.666
Hey! Look at this!

00:01:49.066 --> 00:01:50.432
Wow!

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:57.500
Last year, I went on holiday to Costa Rica.

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:02.733
Really?

00:02:05.366 --> 00:02:10.999
Yes, and we saw loads of these amazing monkeys.

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:13.600
One of them took my hat!

00:02:18.366 --> 00:02:19.666
You're joiking!

00:02:20.933 --> 00:02:24.033
Or you can say No way!

00:02:27.166 --> 00:02:33.399
After this video, think of four more situations and test your partner.

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:37.966
Remember, practice makes perfect!